# Third-party source trees and their build output.
#
# Unlike Detours (whose 0.6 MB x64\detours.lib is committed), these are not committed:
# rmlui.lib alone is ~48 MB. They are reproduced instead by running build_deps.cmd,
# which pins the versions and the two build settings that must not drift.
#
# A fresh clone therefore needs one run of:  HookDll\thirdparty\build_deps.cmd

